\f0\fs24 \cf2 <!$Scr_Ps::0><$Scr_Ps::1>
\f1\fs22 There was only so long Hayley could remain a remote spectator to the activity, all of it converging which was driving towards the Ironing Room\'97Tony and his entourage, Haloren Smythe, and the agent dressed like a politician who Hayley had since discovered was directing a squad of government commandos. \
Hayley was reasonably certain Smythe had infiltrated Sublime Point and Ruined Castle to pick up from where his previous playdate with Sarah had left off. Tony\'92s motives were obvious\'97he was a Sarah-seeking cleaner with muscle to back him up. She wondered whether Team Chantara of two varieties of clones or Team Government Goons would prevail when they inevitably met as they approached the Ironing Room.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl220\sb220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs24 \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 <!$Scr_Ps::1><$Scr_Ps::0>
\f1\fs22 Kathy was sitting on the bed like a wax exhibit when Hayley arrived at their bunker suite.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs24 \cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
<!$Scr_Ps::0><$Scr_Ps::1>
\f1\fs22 \'93Hey,\'94 Hayley said gently.\
Kathy swiftly looked up. Hayley saw the colour coming back to her face. Kathy offered up her arms for a hug.\
Hayley knelt and embraced her. \'93I have to go out,\'94 she said, cheek-to-cheek with Kathy.\
\'93What\'92s happening?\'94\
\'93Sarah\'92s reached the Ironing Room.\'94\
Hayley felt some rigidity dissolve out of Kathy. She sat back on her haunches and gave Kathy a situation report.\
\'93Have you warned everyone?\'94 Kathy asked.\
\'93Eloise is up to date. She\'92d be well on her way to the Ironing Room by now.\'94\
\'93Isn\'92t that dangerous?\'94\
Hayley snorted. \'93Try telling Eloise that. I think she\'92ll be okay. No one else seems to know the way here or to the Ironing Room, so I don\'92t expect Eloise would encounter any trouble, if she\'92s quick enough.\'94\
\'93Does she have back-up?\'94\
Hayley shook her head. \'93Who would she trust?\'94\
Kathy nodded. \'93What about Chanta? Does he know he might get ambushed?\'94\
\'93I\'92m least worried about him. He\'92s got Elvi 
\f2\i and 
\f1\i0 Jones clones, and they already neutralised Shakti Security to get as far as they have.\'94\
Kathy took her device off the bed.\
Hayley restrained Kathy\'92s hand. \'93Have you heard that guy\'92s ring-tone?\'94\
Kathy laughed. \'93The whole facility would hear it go off.\'94\
\'93His entourage is armed to the teeth.\'94 Hayley shuddered and decided not to tell Kathy about the Gyges discs the Elvi were packing in their guitar cases. \'93Sarah told him to hold tight; he\'92s made his own decisions.\'94\
Kathy pouted.\
\'93Yeah, I know you\'92ve got history with him,\'94 Hayley said.\
Kathy considered, then brightened. \'93Threesome?\'94\
It was Hayley\'92s turn to laugh, glad Kathy\'92s humour was returning. No, wait. Kathy was serious.\
\'93It\'92s Haloren Smythe that worries me the most\'97followed by the PAPER operative, if he detaches from his henches.\'94\
\'93You\'92re going after them,\'94 Kathy said.\
Hayley held eye contact. \'93Yes. Smythe first.\'94\
\'93I\'92m coming with you.\'94\
Hayley exhaled. \'93I\'92m sorry. You\'92ll slow me down.\'94\
\'93Am I safe here on my own?\'94\
\'93Safer than with me.\'94\
\'93And you\'92re safer without me\'85\'94 \
Hayley said nothing, but she did\'85 eventually nod. \'93Make your way to the core of the bunker. You\'92ll find weapons caches and fortified spaces.\'94\
They embraced. Kathy leant back and toppled Hayley onto the bed with her, then groped her in manner that was as expert as it was familiar.\
Hayley broke off and stood. \'93I\'92ll see you soon.\'94\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl220\sb220\qj\partightenfactor0

